{#
  A booked refund (D-3, decision F4), to the customer, in the language of the
  order, with the cancellation or invoice correction attached where one was
  issued.

  Two cases, and the mail says which: money goes back (payout), or nothing
  had been paid beyond what is still owed and the amount due fell instead
  (payout ''). § 357 Abs. 3 BGB / § 14 Abs. 1 FAGG want the refund made with
  the means of payment used — the sentence says so; making it happen is the
  operator's.

  Loaded as @Contao/mail/consho_refund_booked.html.twig. Parameters are a LIST.

  Variables:
    order       the order in InvoiceView's shape, in the order's language
    customer    {name, email}
    withdrawal  the withdrawal number
    payout      the amount paid back, formatted; '' where nothing is paid back
    credit      the amount credited, formatted
    documents   the numbers of the attached documents, comma-separated; '' where none
    viewUrl     the order page, with a token; '' where the shop has none
    remaining   what is still to pay, formatted; '' where nothing is (F3b —
                an invoice issued with the refund carries no Giro-Code, so
                this sentence is the only place naming the amount)
    kept        the value compensation kept back for a service, formatted;
                '' where none (Abo-8, P81)
    subscriptions  the numbers of the subscriptions the withdrawal ended,
                comma-separated; '' where none (P78, P81)
#}
{% block subject %}{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.subject'|trans([withdrawal, order.orderNumber], 'contao_default') }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% set font = 'font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #222222;' %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #f4f4f4;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 24px 12px;">
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_head.html.twig' %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background: #ffffff; {{ font }}">
<tr><td style="padding: 24px 28px;">

<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.salutation'|trans([customer.name], 'contao_default') }}</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.intro'|trans([withdrawal, order.orderNumber], 'contao_default') }}</p>

{% if payout %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;"><strong>{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.payout'|trans([payout], 'contao_default') }}</strong></p>
{% else %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;"><strong>{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.credit'|trans([credit], 'contao_default') }}</strong></p>
{% endif %}

{% if vouchers|default('') %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.vouchers'|trans([vouchers], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if kept %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.valueCompensation'|trans([kept], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if subscriptions %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.subscriptionEnded'|trans([subscriptions], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if remaining %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.remaining'|trans([remaining], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if documents %}
<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.refund.documentAttached'|trans([documents], 'contao_default') }}</p>
{% endif %}

{% if viewUrl %}
<p style="margin: 24px 0 0 0;">
    <a href="{{ viewUrl }}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #222222; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 3px;">{{ 'CONSHO.mail.viewOrder'|trans({}, 'contao_default') }}</a>
</p>
{% endif %}

</td></tr>
</table>
{% include '@Contao/mail/_frame_foot.html.twig' %}
</td></tr>
</table>
{% endblock %}
